    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Nobar T1",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Nobar el Viajero\n\u0022\u00A1Saludos, mi se\u00F1or! Me alegro de veros a salvo. El Inquisidor Philip d\u0027Agincourt est\u00E1 esper\u00E1ndoos en la ciudad de Fhindar, al norte. Os guiar\u00E9...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN0023",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Lancero",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Nobar T2",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Nobar el Viajero\n \u0022\u00A1Cuidado! \u00A1Esos r\u00EDos est\u00E1n habitados por brujas marinas que atacan a los viajeros desprevenidos! \u00A1No permanezc\u00E1is en el agua!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN0024",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Nobar muerto",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN0025",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN0026",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Nobar central 1",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Lancero\n\u0022Lo siento, Nobar... Nadie excepto t\u00FA puede pasar. \u00A1\u00D3rdenes de Philip!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN0027",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Nobar Central 2",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Lancero \n\u0022Saludos, Nobar. Excepto t\u00FA, nadie puede cruzar este punto. \u00C9sas son las \u00F3rdenes de Philip d\u0027Agincourt...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0005",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ara\u00F1a deambular T10",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN0028",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN0029",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ej\u00E9rcito de Hubert T30",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Hubert de Lalye\n\u0022\u00BFTe gustan mis aterciopelados amigos? Deber\u00EDas haberte unido a m\u00ED como los otros... \u00A1Ahora morir\u00E1s y Fhindar ser\u00E1 m\u00EDa! Ja ja ja ja...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Explorador\n\u0022\u00A1Se\u00F1or! \u00A1Debemos detener a Hubert de Lalye antes de que capture la ciudad de Fhindar!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 5
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "OBJECT_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Destruir a Hubert de Lalye antes de que capture la ciudad de Fhindar. Uther debe sobrevivir.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ara\u00F1as deambular T20",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Explorador\n\u0022\u00A1Algo est\u00E1 expulsando a las ara\u00F1as de su guarida! Nuestros batidores vieron humo saliendo del Bosque de la Seda... \u00BFQui\u00E9n podr\u00EDa hacer algo as\u00ED?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 5
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Llegada Uther T33",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Uther\n\u0022\u00A1Limpiar\u00E9 el Imperio de los de tu sucia clase, Hubert de Lalye! Prep\u00E1rate a morir... \u00A1Le devolver\u00E9 el Imperio a su verdadero due\u00F1o!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Hubert de Lalye \n\u0022\u00BFUn chico? \u00A1Ja ja ja! \u00A1\u00C9sta es toda la protecci\u00F3n del Imperio! Dem\u00F3stenes es un cobarde.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 4
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN002c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Lancero",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Aviso Bosque de la Seda",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Nobar el Viajero\n\u0022Aquellos bosques se llaman Bosques de la Seda. Pocos se aventuran all\u00ED porque temen a las salvajes criaturas que acechan en el lugar...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN002d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN002e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Entrar Fhindar",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Nobar el Viajero\n\u0022\u00A1Fhindar est\u00E1 cerca! Debes ir al oeste. Hay m\u00E1s de un paso que lleva hasta all\u00ED...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN002f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Lancero",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Nobar T5",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Nobar el Viajero\n\u0022Philip d\u0027Agincourt es muy precavido... Ha bloqueado todos los pasos a Fhindar. \u00A1Espero que te permita pasar!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN0030",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN0031",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Lancero bajo muere",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN0032",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV000f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Lancero alto muere",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Victoria b\u00FAsqueda (Matar a Hubert)",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Hubert de Lalye\n\u0022T\u00FA... T\u00FA... \u00A1Me has derrotado! \u00BFC\u00F3mo es posible? \u00A1Maldito seas, Uther!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Uther \n\u0022Todos los enemigos del Imperio correr\u00E1n la misma suerte. \u00A1Ayudar\u00E9 a mi padre a restablecer la paz en el reino de Nevendaar!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN0034",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Oso polar",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Hubert gana",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Hubert de Lalye\n\u0022\u00A1Ja ja ja! Ahora que poseo la ciudad de Fhindar, no podr\u00E1s resistirte a m\u00ED... \u00A1La llegada de Uther no sirvi\u00F3 de nada!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0012",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Texto de la ciudad de Torre\u00F3n de Khazan",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0012",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Arquero\n\u0022Han desaparecido muchos pescadores en el mar... \u00A1Los campesinos dicen que fueron devorados por criaturas marinas!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095UN0036",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Sirena",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Texto de la ciudad de Silveria",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S095EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Lancero\n\u0022Fhindar est\u00E1 un poco m\u00E1s al norte. Esperemos que el Emperador gane esta guerra... \u00A1Hubert ha enviado a la milicia para que asegure todas las ciudades de estas tierras!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S095SC0000",
